          "problem": "S10 drops cells with P90 at or above $100 nominal. The estimate is therefore conditional on cells below the ceiling and likely attenuated for high-wage occupations.",
          "fix": "State this interpretation constraint in the table notes and the manuscript (already partly noted in the Table 2 notes).",
          "status": "non_blocking_disposition"
        },
